This licence covers the pz-world source code only. Two other things travel with
a generated world and are not this project's to license:

  * **Map data** comes from OpenStreetMap and is © OpenStreetMap contributors,
    licensed under the Open Database Licence 1.0
    (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright). Every generated world carries an
    ATTRIBUTION.txt and the mod.info records it. If you share a world you
    generated, that attribution has to travel with it.

  * **Building interiors** are read out of your own copy of Project Zomboid at
    build time and are The Indie Stone's work. This project never stores or
    redistributes them: `library/` is gitignored, it is rebuilt from your
    install by `npm run extract`, and it is specific to your game version. Do
    not commit it, and do not publish a generated map directory that contains
    it.
